topic: ~water_keywords()

# Filming version (15 Nov, Roaa: "only make it answer to is the water drinkable"): one question, live from the sensor.
# Any sentence with drink / drinking / drinkable / potable -> the live salinity and the drinking verdict, built by
# code on the laptop (about 0.1 s) and spoken by the conversation ($answer). If the laptop can't be reached,
# AskExecutor says a fixed answer instead of nothing.

u:({*} [drink drinking drinkable potable] {*}) ^execute(ask, now:drink) $answer
